cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark results, please cite it as below."
title: "SmartCampus: a course-timetabling engine with reproducible benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  SmartCampus provides a post-enrolment university course timetabling engine with an exact
  incremental cost model, constructive (greedy, largest-degree, DSATUR) and simulated-annealing
  solvers, a seeded synthetic instance generator and a paired benchmarking harness reporting
  bootstrap confidence intervals, exposed through a Spring Boot REST service alongside a
  university-management domain library.
type: software
authors:
